# Test files

Vitest files are `*.test.ts` in `test/unit/` or `test/integration/`. No `.tsx`, no JSX.

- UI tests start with `// @vitest-environment jsdom`.
- Server tests use the default Node environment.

Playwright specs are `test/e2e/<name>.spec.ts`. Page classes are `test/e2e/pages/<screen>-page.ts`. Plans are `test/e2e/plan/<name>.plan.md`.

- Locators live on the page class. Prefer `getByRole`.
- Assertions live in the spec.
